              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h1>Book Tiles</h1><p>Book Tiles renders a grid of OpenStax book covers, each with a title link, an optional overlay badge, and a per-book “Get the book” dropdown menu. Covers and titles are loaded from OpenStax book data by UUID; every link destination is configured per book.</p><p>This block ships in <code>@openstax/flex-page-os-blocks</code> — it is coupled to OpenStax book data, so it lives outside the generic renderer.</p>",
                  "id": "0001-text-intro"
                }
              ],
              "config": [
                {
                  "type": "padding",
                  "value": 4,
                  "id": "0001-cfg-pad"
                }
              ]
            },
            "id": "0001-section-intro"
          },
          {
            "type": "section",
            "value": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h2>Example</h2><p>Three books: two available (with full dropdown menus) and one coming soon (no menu, so its button is disabled and relabeled per book).</p>",
