          {
            "type": "section",
            "value": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h2>Configuration</h2><p>The block takes a default <strong>button text</strong> and a list of <strong>books</strong>. Each book is identified by its CNX <strong>UUID</strong> (used to load the cover and title) and configures its own behavior:</p><ul><li><strong>Title link</strong> — where the cover and title link to.</li><li><strong>Badge</strong> — an optional overlay image. In production the CMS supplies it per book; here College Success shows the “Available in Assignable” badge.</li><li><strong>Menu</strong> — dropdown sections of links. Each item is a dynamic link target: <code>external</code> URLs render as links, while <code>action</code> targets (like “Order a print copy” here) defer to a handler the host app registers — in this example, the demo <code>alert</code> action.</li><li><strong>Button text override</strong> — per book; doubles as the disabled label when a book has no menu (the “Coming soon” book above).</li></ul><p>Menu sections are kept as separate groups so dividers can render once the shared dropdown supports them; today they are flattened into one menu.</p>",
                  "id": "0003-text-docs"
                }
              ],
              "config": [
                {
                  "type": "padding",
                  "value": 4,
                  "id": "0003-cfg-pad"
                }
              ]
            },
            "id": "0003-section-docs"
          }
        ]
